interaction fact-surface-registry-renders-in-web-address
  source fact-surface-registry
  destination cmd-web-address
  relation registry_rows_to_shell_pages
  preserves each row's audience check, store lease, row limit and plain words
  drops every write path; the renderer has none
  forbidden_inference a page under /x -> a new authority, a verified record or a permitted action
  invalidates_on the route table, the shell or the session checks changing
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/fact_surfaces_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/generated/native_fact_surfaces.h
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/fact_surface_web.h
